From 789eb5b22a4896da779139e3497f1d5ba260f04c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Sam Day <me@samcday.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 09:31:00 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] tee: qseecom: support Sargo ELF64 images and harden
 session lifetimes

Support validated little-endian ELF32 and ELF64 contiguous image assembly and privileged boot-lifetime cmnlib loading. Serialize image loads, preserve active app identities, hold sessions through commands, fix listener shared-buffer lifetime, and reject transfer overflow and reused session generations. Keep the provisional userspace ABI documented.

Assisted-by: Codex:GPT-6
